  {
    "id": "T-68",
    "thread_id": "M-cascade-2026-08-14",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Marcus Webb", "role": "Analytics Manager", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-14",
    "meeting": { "title": "Cascade Recovery Discussion", "date": "2026-08-14" },
    "seq": 12,
    "text": "Appreciate that. Let's talk again once I've seen it."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-69",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Partner", "role": "Engagement Partner", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 1,
    "text": "Elena, thank you for making time, I know this has been a frustrating few weeks."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-70",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 2,
    "text": "I want to be blunt, trust is pretty much gone at this point. Every status report says green until it's suddenly not."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-71",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Partner", "role": "Engagement Partner", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 3,
    "text": "That's on us, and I take that seriously."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-72",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 4,
    "text": "I found out about the API mapping issue from my own team, not from yours, even though it had apparently been known for a week."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-73",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 5,
    "text": "That shouldn't have happened, and I'm sorry it did."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-74",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 6,
    "text": "I need more than an apology. I need to see it fixed, and soon, or we're going to have a bigger conversation about this contract."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-75",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Partner", "role": "Engagement Partner", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 7,
    "text": "Understood. I'm personally taking ownership of the root cause analysis, you'll have it by end of next week."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-76",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 8,
    "text": "That's the second time I've been told I'll have something \"by end of week.\""
  },
  {
    "id": "T-77",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Partner", "role": "Engagement Partner", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 9,
    "text": "Fair. I'll commit to a specific date instead, you'll have the RCA by July 29th end of day."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-78",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 10,
    "text": "Noted. I'm holding you to that."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-79",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-07-29",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-07-29",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Escalation Call", "date": "2026-07-29" },
    "seq": 11,
    "text": "We'll also set up a daily check-in with your team until we're back on track."
