    "id": "T-82",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 2,
    "text": "Honestly I've stopped expecting good news on this workstream, which is not where I want to be six months in."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-83",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 3,
    "text": "Understood, we're bringing a revised plan to the QBR."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-84",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 4,
    "text": "What's actually in it? I don't want another slide of good intentions."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-85",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 5,
    "text": "A revised timeline with named owners on each milestone, and a proposal to bring in a senior integration lead full-time."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-86",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 6,
    "text": "That's closer to what I need to see. Is the RCA finally attached to it?"
  },
  {
    "id": "T-87",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 7,
    "text": "Yes, root cause and the corrective actions are both in there."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-88",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 8,
    "text": "I'll reserve judgment until I see it hold for more than two weeks."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-89",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 9,
    "text": "That's fair. We know this has to be sustained, not a one-time save."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-90",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 10,
    "text": "I also want to be upfront, leadership on our side is asking whether this scope should move to a different vendor entirely."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-91",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "outbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Engagement Lead", "role": "Engagement Lead", "org": "Us" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 11,
    "text": "I appreciate you telling me directly. We want the chance to prove this can turn around before that conversation goes further."
  },
  {
    "id": "T-92",
    "thread_id": "M-delta-2026-08-22",
    "kind": "transcript_turn",
    "direction": "inbound",
    "contact": { "name": "Elena Vasquez", "role": "Program Sponsor", "org": "Meridian Holdings" },
    "date": "2026-08-22",
    "meeting": { "title": "Delta Pre-QBR Sync", "date": "2026-08-22" },
    "seq": 12,
    "text": "Then Thursday's QBR matters more than any of us want to admit."
  }
